    "causal_summary": "This repo runs 5 native MCP servers (`sequentialthinking`, `mk-spec-memory`, `mkskilladvisor`, `mkcodeindex`, `codemode`) that Claude Code and OpenCode already reach via `.mcp.json`'s stdio `{command, args, env}` shape, plus 10 external UTCP manuals (`chromedevtools1/2`, `aside`, `clickupofficial`, `figma`, `github`, `gitkraken`, `opendesign`, `refero`, `mobbin`) reached transitively through `codemode`'s own tool surface",
